"Tunisia": [["The ancient city of Carthage, rival of Rome, stood here.", "Parts of Star Wars were filmed in its desert towns."], ["Hier lag Karthago, die antike Rivalin Roms.", "Teile von Star Wars wurden in seinen Wüstenorten gedreht."]],
